## 12  Third‑Party Risk

|                        |                   |                                                         |
| ---------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
| Vendor                 | Risk              | Mitigation                                              |
| OpenAI / Anthropic API | PII exposure, SLA | EU regional endpoint, TLS; fallback model; DPA executed |
